statement:
Assume DeformationTheorem. Let m, ℓ ∈ ℕ with ℓ ≥ 1, and let X_k ∈ D_{m+1}(ℝ^{m+1+ℓ}) (k ∈ ℕ) be integer multiplicity currents with M(X_k) + M(∂X_k) < ∞. Then there exist:
- ρ : ℕ → ℝ with ρ_k > 0, ρ antitone and ρ_k → 0;
- integer coefficients β_k : LatticeFaceIndex (m+1) (m+1+ℓ) → ℤ;
- currents Pc_k ∈ D_{m+1}(ℝ^{m+1+ℓ}) with IsLatticeChain ρ_k β_k Pc_k for every k;
such that Pc_k(ω) − X_k(ω) → 0 for every ω ∈ D^{m+1}(ℝ^{m+1+ℓ}).
